Breaks: a namespace drop on PostgreSQL and CockroachDB locks the namespace before the catalog's row, against the lock order every other write keeps (catalog first), so it can deadlock with a conditional grant on the namespace (backlog 158).
Module: catalog-store-sql
Test: SqlLockOrderTest#aNamespaceDropLocksTheCatalogForShareBeforeTheNamespaceAndReadsRefsAfterBoth

